  "description": "LineTen messaging v3 composition root. Provides AddLineTenMessaging(serviceName),\n      AddBus<TBus>, AddPerformer<TPerformer, TMessage> with fluent options, and a\n      startup-time validator (IHostedService) that fails fast on misconfigured\n      registrations. Transport selection (UseAzureServiceBus, UseInMemory) lives in\n      the respective transport packages, which add their own extensions on\n      IBusOptionsBuilder<TBus>. See ADR-0007 for the packaging rationale.",
